<title>UK: Sotheby's appoints chief operating officer.</title>
<headline>Sotheby's appoints chief operating officer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sotheby's Holdings Inc announced on Monday the appointment of Kevin Bousquette to the new position of executive vice president and chief operating officer of the auction to property group.</p>
<p>Bousquette will also join the board of the main group. He will oversee the daily running of auctions, real estate and finance operations.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
